{
  "dom_id": "step-e12802",
  "name": "Example: Simplifying Linear Expressions With Positive Numbers in Parentheses",
  "problem": "Simplify $(4+c)\\cdot 3-8.$",
  "worked_solution": "First, we distribute the $3$ over each of the terms in parentheses.\n\n$$\n\\eqalign{\n\t\t(4+c)\\cdot 3-8 &= \\[5pt]\n\t\t4\\cdot3+c\\cdot 3-8 &= \\[5pt]\n\t\t(12)+(3c)-8 &= \\[5pt]\n\t\t12+3c-8 &\n\t}\n$$\n\nThen, we collect like terms.\n\n$$\n\\eqalign{\n\t\t12+3c-8 &= \\[5pt]\n\t\t3c +(12-8)&= \\[5pt]\n\t\t3c+4\n\t}\n$$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-e12802\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block;\">\n    \n                 \n                <div class=\"example\">\n                    <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                        <div class=\"stepName\"><span class=\"stepType\">Example:</span> Simplifying Linear Expressions With Positive Numbers in Parentheses</div>       \n                        <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"e12802\">?</div>\n                    </div>\n            \n                    <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                        <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage 